      "sid": 1,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "今天我来到了美国最穷的密西西比州的迪斯高",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 2.68,
      "to": 3.1,
      "sid": 2,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "建筑",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 3.1,
      "to": 5.04,
      "sid": 3,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "gold strike赌场酒店的楼下",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 5.04,
      "to": 7.81,
      "sid": 4,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "这是蒂尼卡度假区六座赌场中的一座",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 7.81,
      "to": 11.17,
      "sid": 5,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "这边曾经是美国仅次于拉斯维加斯和大西洋城",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 11.17,
      "to": 12.75,
      "sid": 6,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "的第三大赌博目的地",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 12.75,
      "to": 15.28,
      "sid": 7,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "但是帝尼卡度假区并不是一个城市",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 15.28,
      "to": 17.3,
      "sid": 8,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "这边除了六座超大的赌场",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 17.3,
      "to": 19.48,
      "sid": 9,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "剩余的地方都是密西西比河畔的",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 19.48,
      "to": 21.2,
      "sid": 10,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "棉花田和玉米地",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 21.2,
      "to": 23.96,
      "sid": 11,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "这里连居民区和吃饭的地方都没有",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 23.96,
      "to": 26.74,
      "sid": 12,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "那么为什么这些赌场或许咱这里开业呢",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 26.74,
      "to": 29.32,
      "sid": 13,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "其实你只要看一下这边停车场的车的车牌",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 29.32,
      "to": 30.18,
      "sid": 14,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "就知道了",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 30.18,
      "to": 31.84,
      "sid": 15,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "全部都是外周的",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 31.84,
      "to": 33.24,
      "sid": 16,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "帝尼卡度假区的位置",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 33.24,
      "to": 34.1,
      "sid": 17,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "在阿肯色州",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 34.1,
      "to": 36.66,
      "sid": 18,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "田纳西州和密西西比州交界的地方",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 36.66,
      "to": 38.94,
      "sid": 19,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "这边离区域性的大城市孟菲斯",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 38.94,
      "to": 40.54,
      "sid": 20,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "只要半个小时的车程",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 40.54,
      "to": 42.0,
      "sid": 21,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "这里甚至离密苏里",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 42.0,
      "to": 42.6,
      "sid": 22,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "肯塔基",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 42.6,
      "to": 44.7,
      "sid": 23,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "阿拉巴马这样的地方也不是很远",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 44.7,
      "to": 46.569,
      "sid": 24,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "这些都是非常保守的州",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 46.569,
      "to": 49.22,
      "sid": 25,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "都有很严格的法律限制赌博",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 49.22,
      "to": 52.66,
      "sid": 26,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "或者说在最近几年内才把赌博合法化",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 52.66,
      "to": 55.54,
      "sid": 27,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "而密西西比州在1990年代就合法化了",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 55.54,
      "to": 56.23,
      "sid": 28,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "赌场",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 56.23,
      "to": 58.77,
      "sid": 29,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "那个时候合法化赌博的地方很少",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 58.77,
      "to": 59.89,
      "sid": 30,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "人们想去赌",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 59.89,
      "to": 61.54,
      "sid": 31,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "只能去拉斯维加斯",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 61.54,
      "to": 64.3,
      "sid": 32,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "主要是因为密西西比州实在是太穷了",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 64.3,
      "to": 65.86,
      "sid": 33,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "得发展一下新产业",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 65.86,
      "to": 67.25,
      "sid": 34,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "增加一点收入",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 67.25,
      "to": 69.83,
      "sid": 35,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "现在密西西比州最高的五座大楼",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 69.83,
      "to": 72.01,
      "sid": 36,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "除了第三高的是一个办公楼",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 72.01,
      "to": 74.43,
      "sid": 37,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "其他四栋楼都是赌场酒店",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 74.43,
      "to": 76.75,
      "sid": 38,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "好了带大家看看里面是什么样的",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 76.75,
      "to": 78.83,
      "sid": 39,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "大部分都是那些退休了的老白人",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 78.83,
      "to": 80.31,
      "sid": 40,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "来这边消遣时间",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 80.31,
      "to": 82.97,
      "sid": 41,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "而这边大部分工作的员工都是黑人",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 82.97,
      "to": 85.95,
      "sid": 42,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "毕竟整个地尼卡县人口构成是76%",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 85.95,
      "to": 87.15,
      "sid": 43,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "黑人19%",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 87.15,
      "to": 90.35,
      "sid": 44,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "白人大部分本地人都来这个赌场工作了",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 90.35,
      "to": 91.45,
      "sid": 45,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "然后最魔幻的是",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 91.45,
      "to": 92.45,
      "sid": 46,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "这个赌场的牌照",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 92.45,
      "to": 95.21,
      "sid": 47,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "是隔壁俄克拉荷马切洛基人部落的",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 95.21,
      "to": 97.67,
      "sid": 48,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "然后在ghost strike对面还有一家HOSHU",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 97.67,
      "to": 100.19,
      "sid": 49,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "这两家本质上是一个地产商老板的",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 100.19,
      "to": 102.9,
      "sid": 50,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "但是HOSHU的运营商是凯撒集团",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 102.9,
      "to": 105.92,
      "sid": 51,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "也就是拉斯维加斯凯撒皇宫的那个公司",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 105.92,
      "to": 108.32,
      "sid": 52,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "不得不说这两个赌场都是真的大",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 108.32,
      "to": 110.97,
      "sid": 53,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "虽然说规模没法跟拉斯维加斯的比",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 110.97,
      "to": 113.39,
      "sid": 54,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "但是里面光赌桌就有接近100个",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 113.39,
      "to": 114.43,
      "sid": 55,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "值得一提的是",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 114.43,
      "to": 117.1,
      "sid": 56,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "这个house sho隔壁原来有第三家赌场",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 117.1,
      "to": 119.18,
      "sid": 57,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "但是由于客流的持续减少",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 119.18,
      "to": 120.82,
      "sid": 58,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "前两年他就被拆掉了",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 120.82,
      "to": 122.74,
      "sid": 59,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "其实蒂尼卡度假区在巅峰的时候",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 122.74,
      "to": 124.42,
      "sid": 60,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "一共有11家大赌场",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 124.42,
      "to": 125.62,
      "sid": 61,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "现在只剩下六家",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 125.62,
      "to": 126.14,
      "sid": 62,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "家的原因是",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 126.14,
      "to": 129.389,
      "sid": 63,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "因为密西西比很多林州慢慢把赌场给合法化了",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 129.389,
      "to": 131.849,
      "sid": 64,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "所有人都知道赌场是稳赚不赔的",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 131.849,
      "to": 133.749,
      "sid": 65,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "与其让本周的人跨越州界",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 133.749,
      "to": 135.11,
      "sid": 66,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "当西西比州送钱",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 135.11,
      "to": 137.31,
      "sid": 67,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "不如让他们在本地促进一下消费",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 137.31,
      "to": 138.99,
      "sid": 68,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "现在越来越多喜欢赌博的人",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 138.99,
      "to": 140.89,
      "sid": 69,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "发现自己家附近就有赌场了",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 140.89,
      "to": 143.23,
      "sid": 70,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "因此他们就没有什么必要开好久的车来",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 143.23,
      "to": 144.36,
      "sid": 71,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "蒂米卡度假区",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 144.36,
      "to": 146.2,
      "sid": 72,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "我现在所在的是蒂米卡度假区",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 146.2,
      "to": 148.44,
      "sid": 73,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "一个刚刚荒废的小型度假酒店",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 148.44,
      "to": 150.49,
      "sid": 74,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "既然连大型赌场都倒闭了",
      "music": 0.0
    },
    {
      "from": 150.49,
      "to": 153.31,
